歌詞:LORI Framework        歌曲:Gemini

浩瀚的宇宙 人的渺小
如果時間空間能夠重疊，哪怕只是一瞬間，
給予那些因災難、戰亂而分離的人
能夠找到彼此相遇的路
擁有一個好好道別機會，
彌補所有未曾說出口的遺憾
------
In the vastness of the universe, humanity is small.
If time and space could overlap—even for just a moment—
give those separated by disaster and war
a way to find each other again,
a chance to say a proper goodbye,
and to make up for all the words left unspoken.
